#: includes/email/ppcart-template-functions/templates.php:230
msgid ""
"Order ID: {order_id}\n"
"Order Date: {order_date}\n"
"\n"
"You're receiving this email because we have processed your refund of {last_refund_amount}. It can take up to 10 days to appear on your statement, if it takes longer please contact your bank for assistance."
msgstr ""
"Bestel-ID: {order_id}\n"
"Besteldatum: {order_date}\n"
"\n"
"U ontvangt deze e-mail omdat we uw terugbetaling van {last_refund_amount} hebben verwerkt. Het kan tot 10 dagen duren voordat het op uw afschrift verschijnt. Als het langer duurt, neem dan contact op met uw bank voor hulp."

#: includes/email/ppcart-template-functions/templates.php:242
msgid "Your {product_name} trial is about to end"
msgstr "Uw {product_name} proefperiode loopt bijna af"

#: includes/email/ppcart-template-functions/templates.php:246
msgid ""
"Hi {customer_firstname},\n"
"\n"
"Your trial is ending on <strong>{next_bill_date}</strong>. Once your trial is complete, we will automatically charge the payment method we have on file for <strong>{order_amount}</strong>.\n"
"\n"
"To cancel your trial, please log in to <a href=\"{login}\">your account</a>.\n"
"\n"
"Thank you,\n"
"{site_name}"
msgstr ""
"Hallo {customer_firstname},\n"
"\n"
"Uw proefperiode eindigt op <strong>{next_bill_date}</strong>. Zodra uw proefperiode is voltooid, zullen we automatisch de betaalmethode die we hebben geregistreerd voor <strong>{order_amount}</strong> in rekening brengen.\n"
"\n"
"Om uw proefperiode te annuleren, logt u in op <a href=\"{login}\">uw account</a>.\n"
"\n"
"Bedankt,\n"
"{site_name}"

#: includes/email/ppcart-template-functions/templates.php:265
msgid "Upcoming payment reminder for {product_name}"
msgstr "Aankomende betalingsherinnering voor {product_name}"

#: includes/email/ppcart-template-functions/templates.php:269
msgid ""
"Hi {customer_firstname},\n"
"\n"
"Just a friendly reminder that we will be automatically charging the payment method we have on file for <strong>{order_amount}</strong> on <strong>{next_bill_date}</strong>.\n"
"\n"
"If you have any questions regarding your upcoming payment, please don't hesitate to get in touch.\n"
"\n"
"Thank you,\n"
"{site_name}"
msgstr ""
"Hallo {customer_firstname},\n"
"\n"
"Gewoon een vriendelijke herinnering dat we de betaalmethode die we hebben geregistreerd voor <strong>{order_amount}</strong> op <strong>{next_bill_date}</strong> automatisch in rekening zullen brengen.\n"
"\n"
"Als u vragen heeft over uw aankomende betaling, aarzel dan niet om contact op te nemen.\n"
"\n"
"Bedankt,\n"
"{site_name}"

